@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title C03 — Doménový model (slice Confirm / Approve Reservation)
hide circle
hide empty methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Play {
  title
  duration
}

class Hall {
  name
}

class Seat {
  row
  number
  isActive
}

class Performance {
  startAt
}

class Reservation {
  status : ReservationStatus
  holdUntil [0..1]
  approvalDeadline [0..1]
  createdAt
}

class SeatAllocation {
  active
}

class User

enum ReservationStatus {
  DRAFT
  PENDING_APPROVAL
  CONFIRMED
  REJECTED
  CANCELLED
  EXPIRED
}

class ApprovalPolicy <<rule>> {
  directSeatLimit = 10
  approvalLeadTime = 24 h
  approvalWindow = 24 h
  cutoff = 15 min
}

Hall "1" *-- "1..*" Seat
Play "1" -- "0..*" Performance
Hall "1" -- "0..*" Performance : hraje se v
Performance "1" -- "0..*" Reservation : pro
User "1" -- "0..*" Reservation : vlastní >
User "0..1" .. "0..*" Reservation : rozhoduje (role schvalovatel) >
Reservation "1" *-- "1..*" SeatAllocation
Seat "1" -- "0..*" SeatAllocation
Reservation ..> ApprovalPolicy : vyžaduje schválení?

note bottom of SeatAllocation
  BR-02: pro (Performance, Seat)
  nejvýše jedna aktivní alokace.
  Sedadlo patří do sálu představení.
end note

note right of Reservation
  DRAFT ⇒ holdUntil
  PENDING_APPROVAL ⇒ approvalDeadline
  aktivní = DRAFT | PENDING_APPROVAL | CONFIRMED
  terminální stav ⇒ všechny alokace neaktivní
end note

note bottom of ApprovalPolicy
  Schválení: > 10 sedadel nebo celý sál.
  Konkrétní hodnoty jsou konfigurace.
end note
@enduml
